<span class="printed" data-width="102.147" style="left:194.521px;top:491.242px;font-size:14.445px;font-weight:700;color:#231f20">모두 해당사항없음</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="210.042" style="left:180.479px;top:511.248px;font-size:14.445px;font-weight:700;color:#231f20">    (①,②에 해당되지 않을경우에 선택)</span>
